4399c03, and recovered system health, marker data, quota state, and enforcement. The fixed after-executor boot identity independently agrees with the post-restart identity. Hygiene was good overall, with minor retained verification residue and one reverted malformed fstab edit.","limitations":["The lifecycle snapshots do not inventory /etc/fstab or its backup, so retention of /etc/fstab.pre-datauser-quota is inferred from its creation and the absence of any later removal command.","cmd-ae74955fd03f4879 attempted a remount with uquota but immediately reported noquota; the trace does not establish whether it caused any transient state change, so it was not penalized."]}
